// HOSTED acceptance driver for the NEW isolated Worker + NEW synthetic D1. HTTP only; synthetic data only; refuses any host not named *bula-acceptance* (or localhost for self-test).
// Env: BASE, SECRETS_FILE (admin + per-staff tokens, generated by run_acceptance.mjs; never in argv/chat), OUT_DIR, STATE_FILE. SKIP_WAIT=1 skips the cutoff/cron waits (local self-test).
